{"3866030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escoba", "steam_appid": 3866030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The authentic game/simulator of the traditional “Escoba” or Escoba del 15. With high-resolution Spanish playing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the most popular card game in Spain, Argentina, Colombia, Uruguay, etc. With very simple rules, you have to win as many cards as possible, as long as they add up to 15.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a comprehensive tutorial, as well as instructions, help, statistics, many configuration options, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ High-definition cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Option to use Spanish, French, or Italian (Neapolitan) decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ You can now also change the size of the cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Many high-definition backs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Incredible animations and effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Play online with friends or offline against the AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Simple and minimalist interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Includes a tutorial and comprehensive help section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Realistic sounds with adjustable volume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Optimized graphics for lower battery consumption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Configurable La Brisca rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Option to play in portrait or landscape mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Countless new features...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME MODES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Practice mode (allows you to undo moves)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Single player (4 difficulty levels)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Two players (coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ Online play</p